{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"2015013010020","name":"甜花","text":"エアコン、効いてるとこで……\r\nお昼寝……","trans":"在有空调的地方……\n午睡……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010030","name":"甜花","text":"最高……！","trans":"最棒了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おーい、甜花──？","trans":"喂——甜花——？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おお、甜花\r\n寝てたのか？","trans":"哦，甜花\n刚才睡着了吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"それじゃあ、邪魔しちゃうみたいで悪いけど\r\n撮影に戻る時間だ","trans":"那么，虽然像在打扰你不太好意思\n但该回去拍摄了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そう落ち込まないでくれ\r\n仕方ないだろ、もう10分前なんだ","trans":"别这么沮丧\n没办法啊，还有十分钟了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-20","name":"プロデューサー","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-23","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ど、どうしたんだ甜花……？","trans":"怎、怎么了甜花……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-25","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おーい、\r\n甜花……──","trans":"喂——\n甜花……——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010110","name":"甜花","text":"甜花の計算だと……","trans":"按甜花的计算……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010120","name":"甜花","text":"ここから、撮影場所まで……\r\n２分あれば、着くから……","trans":"从这里到拍摄地点……\n两分钟就能到……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010130","name":"甜花","text":"だから……\r\nあと８分、寝れる……！","trans":"所以……\n还能睡八分钟……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-36","name":"プロデューサー","text":"もし遅れちゃったらどうするんだ\r\n色んな人に迷惑がかかるんだぞ？","trans":"要是迟到了怎么办\n会给很多人添麻烦的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010140","name":"甜花","text":"プロデューサーさんが……\r\n起こして、くれれば……","trans":"制作人……\n叫醒我的话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-38","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だめだ\r\nほら、行くぞ……！","trans":"不行\n来，走吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-41","name":"プロデューサー","text":"甜花、\r\nちゃんと起きて歩いてくれ","trans":"甜花\n好好起来走路","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010170","name":"甜花","text":"じゃあ……\r\nあと３分……！","trans":"那……\n再三分钟……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010180","name":"甜花","text":"１分でも……\r\nいいから────！","trans":"一分钟也……\n好────！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010190","name":"甜花","text":"え……\r\nでも８分、寝れるよ……？","trans":"诶……\n可是能睡八分钟哦……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-50","name":"プロデューサー","text":"５分だ","trans":"五分钟","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010200","name":"甜花","text":"な、７分……","trans":"那、七分钟……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-54","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……６分でどうだ","trans":"……六分钟怎么样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010210","name":"甜花","text":"…………わかった……","trans":"…………好吧……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010220","name":"甜花","text":"じゃあ……\r\n時間になったら……起こして、ね……","trans":"那……\n到时间了……叫我，哦……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-58","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……ああ\r\nわかったよ","trans":"……嗯\n知道了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010230","name":"甜花","text":"にへへ……\r\nおやすみなさーい……","trans":"嘻嘻……\n晚安——……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-60","name":"プロデューサー","text":"わかった\r\n時間になったら起こすよ","trans":"知道了\n到时间我会叫你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010240","name":"甜花","text":"わ……！\r\nやった……","trans":"哇……！\n太好了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-63","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ああ\r\nほら、時間なくなっちゃうぞ？","trans":"嗯\n喂，时间要没有了哦？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010270","name":"甜花","text":"じゃあ……\r\n８分後、ね……！","trans":"那……\n八分钟后，哦……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015013010290","name":"甜花","text":"……眠く、なくなっちゃった……","trans":"……不困了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}